  "description": "We believe the best rides don't fit neatly into categories. The Hudski Dualist SLX is designed around that idea, a bike that blurs the lines between mountain, gravel, and everyday riding. Equally comfortable taking the long way home, exploring forgotten dirt roads, or heading into the mountains, the Dualist brings together the simplicity, capability, and versatility to make every ride your own.\nBuilt around a lightweight aluminum frame and carbon fork, the Dualist SLX features Shimano SLX components for precise shifting and dependable performance. Choose between two tire options: Gravel, for efficient rolling on pavement and mixed terrain, or Trail, for added traction and confidence on rougher ground. With generous tire clearance, thoughtful mounting options, and balanced geometry, the Dualist is playful on trails, efficient on pavement, and ready for whatever lies between.",
